WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.800
<v Bram Galloway>Thank you for calling Compass, this call may be recorded.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.333
<v Freya Quigley>Hi, yeah, I need to uh, reset my Compass card PIN.

00:00:09.533 --> 00:00:13.000
<v Bram Galloway>I can help. Can I get your full name?

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:15.133
<v Freya Quigley>Freya Quigley.

00:00:15.333 --> 00:00:19.667
<v Bram Galloway>And for verification, your social security number?

00:00:19.867 --> 00:00:24.467
<v Freya Quigley>It's nine three eight two four three three five seven.

00:00:24.667 --> 00:00:27.600
<v Bram Galloway>Sorry, could you repeat that?

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:29.600
<v Freya Quigley>938-24-3357.

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:33.467
<v Bram Galloway>Thank you. And your date of like, birth?

00:00:33.667 --> 00:00:35.333
<v Freya Quigley>October 9.

00:00:35.533 --> 00:00:40.333
<v Bram Galloway>Okay. The new card goes to the address in Corbin Heights?

00:00:40.533 --> 00:00:49.267
<v Freya Quigley>Yes. Oh and my number changed, it's five five five oh one nine... let me redo that, five five five oh one five four.

00:00:49.467 --> 00:00:51.933
<v Bram Galloway>Got it. Anything else?

00:00:52.133 --> 00:00:59.000
<v Freya Quigley>No, wait, yes, I walked past a compass on the way here and remembered the branch closed.

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:03.800
<v Bram Galloway>Right, that branch closed last month. Have a nice day.
